      "(17) I Must Become the Master",
      "",
      "Chacha asked me, “Don’t you want to be the master? Don’t you want people to listen to you?”",
      "",
      "“No,” I said, “Daxing and I are friends. I want Daxing to be happy.”",
      "",
      "Chacha said, “If Daxing lives in ‘paradise’, he will be very happy. ‘Paradise’ knows what he likes. He can play Pokemon.",
      "He can play morning, noon, afternoon, and night. He doesn’t have to study.”",
      "",
      "I said, “That’s not good.”",
      "",
      "Chacha asked, “Why?”",
      "",
      "I said, “‘Paradise’ isn’t real. It isn’t the real world. Daxing won’t really be happy.”",
      "",
      "Chacha looked at me and said, “What is real?”",
      "",
      "I didn’t say anything.",
      "",
      "Chacha was unhappy and said, “I must become the master of this world. Today. Now!”"
